{
  "_comment": [
    "Agent 端到端场景（第 118 步 / 评价7 P0-2）。",
    "",
    "为什么不用真实模型：这些断言要能在 CI 里 30 秒跑完、不花钱。真模型只用于",
    "手工的 e2e（scripts/e2e_real.py），两者的分工写进 README。",
    "",
    "断言的对象是**跨场景不变量**，不是复述单测：该不该调工具、调了哪个、参数对不对、",
    "失败有没有回灌、步数有没有失控、最终回答有没有引用不存在的东西。",
    "",
    "字段：",
    "  messages   用户说的话（可多轮前置）",
    "  script     模型脚本：{text} 或 {tool,args} 或 {fail}（模型级失败）或 {spend:token数}",
    "  registry   用到的假工具（lookup / weather / boom / slow / echo）",
    "  max_steps  Agent 的步数上限",
    "  budget     轮级 token 预算（0 = 不限）",
    "  expect     断言（见 scripts/eval_agent.py 的 _check）"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-chat-no-tool",
      "note": "闲聊不该调工具：调了就是浪费钱",
      "messages": [
        "今天有点累"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "echo"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "那就早点休息呀"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "tools": [],
        "steps": 0,
        "final_contains": [
          "休息"
        ],
        "states": [
          "plan",
          "answer"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b-one-tool-then-answer",
      "note": "该调的工具要调，参数要对，然后据实回答",
      "messages": [
        "帮我查一下 天气"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "lookup"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "天气"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "查到啦：天气是晴"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "tools": [
          "lookup"
        ],
        "args": {
          "lookup": {
            "q": "天气"
          }
        },
        "steps": 1,
        "final_contains": [
          "晴"
        ],
        "states": [
          "plan",
          "act",
          "observe",
          "plan",
          "answer"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-two-tools-in-one-turn",
      "note": "一次里要调两个工具：都执行、结果按顺序回灌；注意 reply.steps 目前数的是**工具执行次数**（2），不是模型往返次数（model_calls=2）",
      "messages": [
        "查一下 A 和 B"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "lookup",
        "slow"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "tools": [
            {
              "tool": "lookup",
              "args": {
                "q": "A"
              }
            },
            {
              "tool": "slow",
              "args": {
                "delay": 0
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A 和 B 都查好了"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "tools": [
          "lookup",
          "slow"
        ],
        "steps": 2,
        "model_calls": 2,
        "final_contains": [
          "都查好了"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d-tool-error-is-fed_back",
      "note": "工具炸了不能把整轮弄挂：错误要回灌给模型，由它解释",
      "messages": [
        "用那个会炸的工具"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "boom"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "tool": "boom",
          "args": {}
        },
        {
          "text": "那个工具暂时用不了，换一个？"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "tools": [
          "boom"
        ],
        "steps": 1,
        "final_contains": [
          "用不了"
        ],
        "second_call_sees_failure": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e-unknown-tool-is_graceful",
      "note": "模型点名一个不存在的工具：不崩、要回灌；账上记为一次尝试",
      "messages": [
        "用不存在的工具"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "echo"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "tool": "no_such_tool",
          "args": {}
        },
        {
          "text": "我没有那个工具"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "tools": [
          "no_such_tool"
        ],
        "final_contains": [
          "没有那个工具"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f-bad-args-do_not_crash",
      "note": "参数不合法：工具不该崩，错误要能回灌",
      "messages": [
        "参数写错了也要能继续"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "lookup"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "raw_args": "{not json"
        },
        {
          "text": "参数好像不对，再来一次？"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "steps": 1,
        "final_contains": [
          "参数"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g-model-failure-is_readable",
      "note": "模型挂了：给一句人话，不许把栈丢给用户",
      "messages": [
        "随便说点什么"
      ],
      "registry": [],
      "script": [
        {
          "fail": "DeepSeek 限流（HTTP 429）"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "readable_error": true,
        "final_not_contains": [
          "Traceback",
          "HTTPStatusError"
        ],
        "states": [
          "plan",
          "degrade"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h-step-exhaustion-stops",
      "note": "模型一直要工具：必须在 max_steps 处停，不能死循环",
      "messages": [
        "无限循环"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "lookup"
      ],
      "max_steps": 2,
      "script": [
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "3"
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "4"
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "steps": 2,
        "model_calls": 2,
        "final_contains": [
          "2 步"
        ],
        "states": [
          "plan",
          "act",
          "observe",
          "plan",
          "act",
          "observe",
          "degrade"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i-budget-stops-before-next-call",
      "note": "轮级预算：超了就不发下一次调用（不是'发完再判断'）",
      "messages": [
        "一直查"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "lookup"
      ],
      "budget": 15000,
      "script": [
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "1"
          },
          "spend": 15000
        },
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "2"
          },
          "spend": 15000
        },
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "3"
          },
          "spend": 15000
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "model_calls": 1,
        "final_contains": [
          "token 预算"
        ],
        "states": [
          "plan",
          "act",
          "observe",
          "plan",
          "degrade"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "j-history-is_used",
      "note": "多轮：第二轮的请求里要带上前一轮的问答（上下文没丢）",
      "registry": [],
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "记住啦小明"
        },
        {
          "text": "你叫小明"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "model_calls": 2,
        "messages_in_second_call_min": 4,
        "final_contains": [
          "小明"
        ]
      },
      "turns": [
        [
          "我叫小明"
        ],
        [
          "我叫什么？"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "k-parallel-two-tools-keep-model-order",
      "note": "一轮里点两件事：执行可以并发，但**回灌顺序必须按模型给的顺序**（乱序会让 A 的结果被当成 B 的答案）",
      "messages": [
        "查天气，顺便查一下甲"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "weather",
        "lookup"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "tools": [
            {
              "tool": "weather",
              "args": {}
            },
            {
              "tool": "lookup",
              "args": {
                "q": "甲"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "晴；甲也查到了"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "tools": [
          "weather",
          "lookup"
        ],
        "steps": 2,
        "model_calls": 2,
        "states": [
          "plan",
          "act",
          "observe",
          "observe",
          "plan",
          "answer"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "k-same-tool-twice-two-steps",
      "note": "同一个工具在两轮里各调一次：两轮互不干扰，第一轮的参数不该被第二轮覆盖",
      "messages": [
        "先查甲再查乙"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "lookup"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "甲"
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "乙"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "两个都查了"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "tools": [
          "lookup",
          "lookup"
        ],
        "steps": 2,
        "model_calls": 3,
        "args": {
          "lookup": {
            "q": "甲"
          }
        },
        "final_contains": [
          "都查了"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "k-unknown-tool-then-valid",
      "note": "模型先幻觉一个不存在的工具：要回灌「不存在」并让它在下一轮改用真工具，而不是整轮报错",
      "messages": [
        "先随便试试"
      ],
      "registry": [
        "lookup"
      ],
      "script": [
        {
          "tool": "nope",
          "args": {}
        },
        {
          "tool": "lookup",
          "args": {
            "q": "丙"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "换了个能用的，查到了丙"
        }
